# Pipeline:
#   DISCOVERY (Freeworld live search / OSM) -> FILTER -> ACCEPTED DOMAIN
#     -> safety/robots pre-check -> crawl.start with collection=<profile collection>
#     -> (after the crawl) classify: PASS / FAIL / UNSURE -> machine-readable metadata
#
# Classification never decides whether a crawl happens and never deletes
# anything: FAIL domains stay in the index. See scoutro_classify.py and
# discovery/schemas/.
