#   SCOUTRO_USER           administrator user, default admin
#   SCOUTRO_PASSWORD       administrator password, or
#   SCOUTRO_PASSWORD_FILE  file containing the password (first line)
#   SCOUTRO_DISCOVERY_DIR  state directory, default ~/.scoutro-discovery
#   SCOUTRO_LLM_*          classifier model settings (see discovery/README.md)
#
# Usage:
#   scoutro-discovery status
#   scoutro-discovery start [--profile P] [--dry-run] [--max-domains N]
#   scoutro-discovery pause | resume
#   scoutro-discovery classify [--profile P] [--domain D] [--backend auto|llm|heuristic]
